    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Isaiah 40:28 — “The LORD is the everlasting God, the Creator of the ends of the earth.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "1 Peter 4:19 — “Entrust their souls to a faithful Creator while doing good.”",
    "GREEK": "Κτίστης",
